# Ignore artifacts:
build
coverage
dist

# Scaffold templates ship verbatim, already in the shape Prettier expects of the
# project they emit. Prettier reads `_package.json` with its `json` parser and the
# emitted `package.json` with `json-stringify`, so formatting here would rewrite
# the template into a shape the emitted project fails on. It would also rewrite
# the `{{token}}` placeholders on some paths.
packages/create/templates

# Mintlify docs are authored in MDX; Prettier dedents fenced code inside JSX and
# Mintlify components, corrupting code samples and breaking component nesting.
packages/docs/**/*.mdx
